Package: RNAflowR
Type: Package
Title: RNA Sequencing Quality Control, Alignment, Counting and Differential Expression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mario", "Gorenjak", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mario.gorenjak@um.si")
Description: An R workflow for RNA sequencing quality assessment, Rsubread
    reference indexing, splice-aware read alignment, featureCounts gene
    quantification, and edgeR/limma-voom differential expression analysis.
    Maintains the original count-per-million filtering approach. Optional
    organism-specific annotation is performed exclusively on differential
    expression results by calcdeg().
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    edgeR,
    limma,
    pheatmap,
    ggplot2,
    ggrepel,
    Rsubread
Suggests:
    AnnotationDbi,
    org.Hs.eg.db
